  "application_type_full": "Full planning & listed building consent",
  "description": "1.\tExisting metal framing to the glazed shopfront to be repainted to RAL8019 Grey Brown. \n2.\tNew entrance doors to match existing painted to RAL8019 Grey Brown with new pull handles in satin brass finish with a solid metal infill panel behind the handles. The existing line of the shopfront remains unchanged. \n3.\tExisting vent grilles to redecorated to RAL8019 Grey Brown.\n4.\tExisting step and entrance threshold to be cladded with Carrara marble with inclusion of brass tactile anti slip studs along the front step. \n5.\tExisting high level linear sign light removed.\n6.\tNew Signage 1 – “DONUTELIER” halo illuminated with warm white LED (2700K) 3D letters, 40mm deep with 10mm frosted acrylic backing, satin brass finish to side and face, Overall size 300mm High x 2365mm Wide. Maximum letter height is 300mm High. Signage letters to be mounted onto metal tray facia spray painted to RAL9003 Signal White. Fascia to be mounted in front of existing louvres. Fascia dimensions are 350mm High x 4900mm Wide.\n7.\tNew security camera, in black, mounted at high level on existing vent grilles.\n8.\tNew security alarm, mounted at high level on left hand pilaster.\n",
